		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>This fey, an unsavory blend of kobold and chihuahua, brings ill fortune upon mortals. Reviled as bad luck, their presence can ruin a gambling hall forever.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 1, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 dagger (close/near) +1 (1d4) or shortbow (far) +1 (1d4), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> -4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 0</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Misfortune</strong>. All mortals within near suffer constant bad luck, rolling all checks and attacks with DISADV for 1d4 rounds. Beings with luck tokens are unaffected by misfortune.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
